msgid "3.1 View the Current State of Each Store"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:65
msgid ""
"A value of 1 means the Store corresponding to that `worker_rank` is "
"available. A value of 0 means it is fused. This query is the most direct "
"way to locate an unhealthy worker Store or scheduler Store."
