#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:190
msgid "5. Alerting Recommendations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:192
msgid "5.1 A Posix Circuit Breaker Remains Fused"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:200
msgid ""
"Configure a suitable `for` duration, such as 30 seconds, so a brief "
"observation-side fluctuation does not immediately trigger a notification."
" The circuit breaker already filters individual probe failures through "
"its sliding window, so the alert delay should not replace the breaker "
"logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:202
msgid "5.2 The Probe Failure Ratio Remains High"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:204
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Use the failure ratio from section 3.4 and require enough failure samples"
" in the window. For example, alert when the failure ratio exceeds 20% "
"over 15 minutes and there are at least three failed probes. Tune the "
"thresholds for the Store probe interval, Store count, and service "
"tolerance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:206
msgid "6. Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:208
msgid "When a Gauge is 0 or a failure Counter increases:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:210
msgid "Locate the affected process by `instance`, `engine`, and `worker_rank`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:211
msgid ""
"Search UCM logs for `Store health check` and `transitioned to "
"UNHEALTHY/HEALTHY`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:212
msgid ""
"For Posix, check mount state, directory permissions, free space, and "
"read/write/remove operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:213
msgid ""
"For Mooncake, check the client, metadata/master services, network, and "
"Put/Get/Remove path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:214
msgid ""
"Confirm that requests are triggering connector metric synchronization and"
" that the Prometheus target is UP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:215
msgid ""
"After the backend recovers, verify consecutive successful probes and "
"confirm that the Gauge returns to 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/health_metrics.md:217
msgid ""
"Import `examples/metrics/grafana_ucm_overview.json` in Grafana to view "
"healthy/fused Store counts and Posix/Mooncake probe trends."
msgstr ""

